      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Increase Number of Charges\"\nslug: \"increase-number-of-charges\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 1\"\ntier: \"Tier 1\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Gadgeteer's Gambit or an Artificer device feature\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Increases the number of charges available to Artificer devices.\"\nsynergy: \"Supports gadgets, reactors, enchanted tools, and charge-based inventions.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-1\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 3\n---\n\n# Increase Number of Charges\n\n## Overview\nIncreases the number of charges available to Artificer devices.\n\n## Rank 1\nIncrease available charges for eligible Artificer creations.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove charge storage and field reliability.\n\n## Rank 3\nExpand charge capacity for more advanced devices.\n\n## Rank 4\nBoost charge retention for larger inventions.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaximize charge capacity for masterwork Artificer devices.\n\n## Prerequisites\nGadgeteer's Gambit or an Artificer device feature\n\n## Scaling\nIncreases the number of charges available to Artificer devices.\n\n## Synergy\nSupports gadgets, reactors, enchanted tools, and charge-based inventions.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n"
