      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Increase Soul Stone Yield\"\nslug: \"increase-soul-stone-yield\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 1\"\ntier: \"Tier 1\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"None\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Improves Soul Stone yield from eligible harvesting, extraction, and refining work.\"\nsynergy: \"Supports Soul Integration, crafting, enchanting, and advanced Artificer resource loops.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-1\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 4\n---\n\n# Increase Soul Stone Yield\n\n## Overview\nImproves Soul Stone yield from eligible harvesting, extraction, and refining work.\n\n## Rank 1\nImprove Soul Stone yield from eligible sources.\n\n## Rank 2\nIncrease efficiency during soul-material collection.\n\n## Rank 3\nRecover more useful soul fragments from difficult sources.\n\n## Rank 4\nImprove advanced soul refinement yield.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaximize Soul Stone extraction and refinement efficiency.\n\n## Prerequisites\nNone\n\n## Scaling\nImproves Soul Stone yield from eligible harvesting, extraction, and refining work.\n\n## Synergy\nSupports Soul Integration, crafting, enchanting, and advanced Artificer resource loops.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n"
