      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Barbarian Mastery\"\nslug: \"barbarian-mastery\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Barbarian\"\nclassSlug: \"barbarian\"\nclassCategory: \"Martial Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 4\"\ntier: \"Tier 4\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Two Barbarian talents\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Improves by rank\"\nsynergy: \"Information coming soon\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"barbarian\"\n  - \"tier-4\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 4\n---\n\n# Barbarian Mastery\n\n## Overview\nImproves by rank\n\n## Rank 1\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Rank 2\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Rank 3\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Rank 4\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Rank 5\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Prerequisites\nTwo Barbarian talents\n\n## Scaling\nImproves by rank\n\n## Synergy\nInformation coming soon\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n"
