      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Druid\"\nslug: \"druid\"\ntype: class\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\nrole: \"Nature caster and shapeshifter\"\nprimary_stat: \"WIS\"\nsecondary_stat: \"END\"\ncombat_style: \"Nature magic and forms\"\nmagic_type: \"Nature\"\ndifficulty: \"Intermediate\"\nclass_colour: \"#35dd86\"\nsymbol: \"D\"\nplayable: true\nstarting_equipment: []\nrecommended_professions: []\ntags:\n  - \"class\"\n  - \"magical-classes\"\n  - \"magical\"\n  - \"nature\"\n  - \"forms\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 5\n---\n\n# Druid\n\n## Overview\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Talent Tree\nTalent pathways live in the talent folders for this class. Each talent has its own page under `talents/tier-*`.\n\n## Lore\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Gallery\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## GM Notes\nGM-only information coming soon.\n"
