      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Paladin\"\nslug: \"paladin\"\ntype: class\nclassCategory: \"Religious Classes\"\nrole: \"Holy warrior\"\nprimary_stat: \"STR\"\nsecondary_stat: \"CHA\"\ncombat_style: \"Weapon and oath magic\"\nmagic_type: \"Divine\"\ndifficulty: \"Intermediate\"\nclass_colour: \"#f5c542\"\nsymbol: \"P\"\nplayable: true\nstarting_equipment: []\nrecommended_professions: []\ntags:\n  - \"class\"\n  - \"religious-classes\"\n  - \"religious\"\n  - \"martial\"\n  - \"oath\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 25\n---\n\n# Paladin\n\n## Overview\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Talent Tree\nTalent pathways live in the talent folders for this class. Each talent has its own page under `talents/tier-*`.\n\n## Lore\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Gallery\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## GM Notes\nGM-only information coming soon.\n"
