      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Phantom\"\nslug: \"phantom\"\ntype: class\nclassCategory: \"Rogue Classes\"\nrole: \"Evasion and apparition specialist\"\nprimary_stat: \"AGI\"\nsecondary_stat: \"LCK\"\ncombat_style: \"Mobility and misdirection\"\nmagic_type: \"Spectral\"\ndifficulty: \"Advanced\"\nclass_colour: \"#64748b\"\nsymbol: \"P\"\nplayable: true\nstarting_equipment: []\nrecommended_professions: []\ntags:\n  - \"class\"\n  - \"rogue-classes\"\n  - \"rogue\"\n  - \"phantom\"\n  - \"evasion\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 28\n---\n\n# Phantom\n\n## Overview\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Talent Tree\nTalent pathways live in the talent folders for this class. Each talent has its own page under `talents/tier-*`.\n\n## Lore\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## Gallery\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## GM Notes\nGM-only information coming soon.\n"
