      "source": "materials/1-common/metals/gold-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Gold Ingot\nslug: gold-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Gold\nsource_items:\n  - Gold Ore\nweight: 1kg\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"35% (+3 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 40\nmarket_price: null\npricing_status: needs-completion\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Gold Ingot\n\n## Effect\nGold Ingots are used primarily for enchantment, relic crafting, and high-value items rather than combat equipment.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Relics\n- Enchanted items\n- Currency systems\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Extremely soft  \n- High magical conductivity  \n- Corrosion resistant  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Reinforces magical items  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Boosts Light, Celestial, and Divine magic  \n- High enchantment stability  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Gold Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Gold carries the memory of the sun.\"*\n"
