      "content": "---\ntitle: Iron Ingot\nslug: iron-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Iron\nsource_items:\n  - Iron Ore\nweight: 1.3kg\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"10% (+0 dice)\"\nimage: Iron Ingot.png\nmarket_value: 12\nmarket_price: null\npricing_status: needs-completion\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Iron Ingot\n\n## Effect\nIron Ingots provide a balanced foundation for weapons and armor, offering durability and structure without advanced properties.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Weapons\n- Armor\n- Structural components\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Strong and reliable  \n- Moderate weight  \n- Holds form well under stress  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[Steel Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Basic enchantment compatibility  \n- Stable but not highly receptive  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Iron Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"The world bends, but iron holds.\"*\n"
