      "title": "Silver Ingot",
      "category": "materials/1-common/metals/silver-ingot",
      "source": "materials/1-common/metals/silver-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Silver Ingot\nslug: silver-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Silver\nsource_items:\n  - Silver Ore\nweight: 1kg\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"30% (+2 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 20\nmarket_price: null\npricing_status: needs-completion\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Silver Ingot\n\n## Effect\nSilver Ingots are prized for their ability to channel divine and spiritual energy, making them ideal for enchanted weapons and relics.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Holy weapons\n- Ritual tools\n- Magical components\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Soft but magically potent  \n- High purity  \n- Reacts to corruption  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Reinforces enchanted weapons  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Boosts Light and Spirit effects  \n- Increased effectiveness vs undead  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Silver Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Silver reveals what darkness hides.\"*\n"
