      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Shadow Combat\"\nslug: \"shadow-combat\"\ntype: skill\ncategory: \"Combat Skills\"\nsubcategory: \"Stealth & Lethality\"\nprimary_stat: \"Agility\"\nsecondary_stat: \"Wisdom\"\nskill_rank: Novice\ntraining_type: \"General Training\"\nvisibility: public\nsummary: \"Shadow Combat is an Asteria stealth & lethality skill governed by Agility, with Wisdom as its supporting characteristic.\"\ntags:\n  - \"skill\"\n  - \"combat-skills\"\n  - \"stealth-and-lethality\"\n---\n\n# Shadow Combat\n\n## Overview\n\nShadow Combat is an Asteria stealth & lethality skill governed by Agility, with Wisdom as its supporting characteristic.\n\n**Primary Characteristic:** Agility  \n**Secondary Characteristic:** Wisdom\n\n## Ranks\n\n| Skill Rank | Affinity Range | Rank Modifier |\n| --- | --- | ---: |\n| Novice | 01-09 | -2 |\n| Initiate | 10-24 | -1 |\n| Apprentice | 25-44 | 0 |\n| Journeyman | 45-69 | +1 |\n| Adept | 70-84 | +2 |\n| Master | 85-97 | +3 |\n| Grandmaster | 98-100 | +4 |\n\nDetailed techniques for Shadow Combat are coming soon.\n\n## Checks\n\nUse **Agility** as the primary characteristic and **Wisdom** as the supporting characteristic when the GM calls for a Shadow Combat check.\n\n## Training\n\nTraining information coming soon.\n\n## Lore\n\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## GM Notes\n\nGM-only information coming soon.\n"
